WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:10.140
Hi, my name is Corinne. I'm a senior in Art and&nbsp;Design and my MIT for the past half a year has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:15.840
been this R&amp;D Pub which is a pub in the Stata Center that's been abandoned for the last three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:22.440
years, and I managed to convince dining and CSAIL to give me a key to the space so that I could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:30.240
transform it into an art installation. So I've been&nbsp;collecting e-waste from all over the school from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:39.240
campus dumpsters and then I've collected around&nbsp;63 screens and I put them all together into a twenty-channel&nbsp;

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:44.940
video installation and this is going to&nbsp;
be open for the public for this spring semester&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:52.260
in the form of performances that take place&nbsp;twice a week. This is just a tour of the space

